  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Research on Improving Systems of Education (RISE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent Impact Evaluation of the Research on Improving Systems of Education programme (RISE). The evaluation covers RISE central global-level activities, as well as country research activities in Ethiopia, Tanzania and Pakistan. The evaluation provides findings and insights on outcomes and impacts of the RISE programme &#x2013; globally, and in the three focal countries. These findings provide accountability for a major FCDO investment and provide transferable lessons for the design of future education research and policy programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
